{"ticker":"VEEV","updated":"2026-10-24T00:24:50Z","profile":{"longName":"Veeva Systems Inc.","shortName":"Veeva Systems Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Health Information Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.veeva.com","fullTimeEmployees":7928,"marketCap":52303036416,"trailingPE":52.95738,"forwardPE":31.514132,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":15.124799,"pegRatio":1.24,"targetMeanPrice":300.55557,"targetHighPrice":360.0,"targetLowPrice":180.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.176,"earningsGrowth":0.395,"grossMargins":0.74961,"operatingMargins":0.29637,"profitMargins":0.29345,"totalRevenue":3458097920,"beta":0.934,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":325.99,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":148.05,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Veeva Systems Inc. provides cloud-based software for the life sciences industry in North America, Europe, the Asia Pacific, the Middle East, Africa, and Latin America. The company offers Veeva Commercial Cloud comprising Veeva Vault CRM Suite for pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies; Veeva Medical that provides source of medical content across multiple channels and geographies; Veeva PromoMats, an end-to-end content and digital asset management solution; and Veeva Crossix, an analytics platform for pharmaceutical brands. It also provides Veeva Data Cloud, such as Veeva OpenData, a customer reference data solution; Veeva Link, which provides deep data; Veeva Compass, which includes de-identified and longitudinal patient data; and Veeva CRM Pulse that provides access and multichannel engagement metrics. In addition, the company offers Veeva Development Cloud consisting of Veeva Clinical Platform, which advances clinical trial execution; Veeva Clinical Data Management that helps sponsors and CROs design and run trials; Veeva Safety, which unifies systems and processes; Veeva RIM that provides regulatory information management capabilities, as well as Veeva Quality Cloud, which is used by the life sciences and consumer products industries; and Veeva Business Consulting services. Further, it provides professional and support services, including implementation and deployment pl","summary_zh":"Veeva Systems Inc. 為北美、歐洲、亞太地區、中東、非洲和拉丁美洲的生命科學產業提供基於雲端的軟體。該公司為製藥和生物技術公司提供包括 Veeva Vault CRM 套件的 Veeva Commercial Cloud； Veeva Medical 提供跨多個管道和地區的醫療內容來源； Veeva PromoMats，端到端內容和數位資產管理解決方案；以及 Veeva Crossix，一個製藥品牌分析平台。它還提供Veeva資料雲，例如Veeva OpenData，客戶參考資料解決方案； Veeva Link，提供深度資料； Veeva Compass，其中包括去識別化的縱向病患資料； Veeva CRM Pulse 提供存取和多通路參與指標。此外，該公司還提供由 Veeva 臨床平台組成的 Veeva 開發雲，可促進臨床試驗的執行； Veeva 臨床數據管理幫助申辦者和 CRO 設計和運行試驗； Veeva Safety，統一系統和流程；提供監管資訊管理功能的 Veeva RIM，以及生命科學和消費品行業使用的 Veeva Quality Cloud；此外，它還提供專業和支援服務，包括實施和部署計劃","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"健康資訊服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":291.16,"h":292.42,"l":285.0,"c":285.18,"v":1270200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":288.03,"h":290.04,"l":285.0,"c":286.54,"v":1340700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":289.7,"h":296.02,"l":288.15,"c":293.59,"v":2672000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":285.34,"h":286.69,"l":271.83,"c":272.33,"v":4469600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":272.56,"h":275.16,"l":266.33,"c":269.2,"v":1999700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":265.26,"h":270.96,"l":264.5,"c":269.98,"v":1495900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":271.32,"h":271.91,"l":268.0,"c":270.95,"v":1316300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":268.3,"h":271.06,"l":262.85,"c":270.06,"v":1266600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":271.59,"h":274.01,"l":270.38,"c":272.93,"v":1440200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":279.0,"h":283.26,"l":275.42,"c":282.78,"v":2253300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":282.35,"h":283.29,"l":276.77,"c":282.68,"v":1046600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":282.27,"h":282.91,"l":273.26,"c":274.6,"v":1527900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":276.81,"h":282.13,"l":276.0,"c":279.47,"v":1432300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":277.38,"h":280.65,"l":273.49,"c":276.43,"v":935700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":276.94,"h":279.96,"l":275.02,"c":276.27,"v":994900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":275.82,"h":276.26,"l":272.25,"c":273.88,"v":925200},