UxNcGZTb1JOU2VMOU53SER1NjJuZ2RyZzBGVXpLa1k2WFN5OU5XcWdXU214eWRSdGw3RkFUalozSmZvdWhDOTJnRVBrekNaaGNJdzl1RUlWbVpHQ3hMQkN5S0pyYTJYMUZaNmlGQ1FWQjh3bzljSkNYNDg3cDJoQjhxeE9wVFduMUZ0SDdZU192NEl0YkZfdjhidGxVQ0pYcER6OWhmMnJmd28zcDJfZXBmejY1SmZTa09fa2E5SG8xdGlZNHQ0b3c?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"Veeva Systems Inc. $VEEV 股票由 Assenagon Asset Management S.A. 出售"},{"title":"Barclays Issues Positive Forecast for Veeva Systems (NYSE:VEEV) Stock Price","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"巴克萊銀行對 Veeva Systems (NYSE:VEEV) 股價做出積極預測"},{"title":"Did Enterprise Client Adoption Just Shift Veeva's (VEEV) Investment Narrative?","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-18","zh":"企業客戶採用是否只是改變了 Veeva (VEEV) 的投資敘事？"}],"themes":[{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-20","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1393052/000139305226000014/veev-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Veeva is the leading provider of industry cloud solutions for the global life sciences industry. Our offerings span cloud software, data, and business consulting and are designed to meet the unique needs of our customers and their most strategic business functions—from research and development (\"R&D\") through commercialization. Our solutions help life sciences companies develop and bring products to market faster and more efficiently, market and sell more effectively, and maintain compliance with government regulations. Our goal is to become the most strategic software, data, and business consulting partner to the life sciences industry, supporting the industry's most critical drug development, quality and manufacturing, and commercialization functions.","zh":"Veeva 是全球生命科學產業產業雲端解決方案的領先供應商。我們的產品涵蓋雲端軟體、數據和業務諮詢，旨在滿足客戶的獨特需求及其最具策略性的業務功能——從研發（「R&D」）到商業化。我們的解決方案幫助生命科學公司更快、更有效率地開發產品並將其推向市場，更有效地進行行銷和銷售，並保持遵守政府法規。我們的目標是成為生命科學產業最具戰略意義的軟體、數據和業務諮詢合作夥伴，支持該行業最關鍵的藥物開發、品質和製造以及商業化功能。"},{"en":"Customer success is one of our core values, and our focus on it has allowed us to deepen and expand our strategic relationships with customers over time. Because of our industry focus, we have a unique, in-depth perspective into the needs and best practices of life sciences companies and clinical research sites. This allows us to develop targeted solutions, quickly adapt to regulatory changes, and incorporate highly relevant enhancements into our existing solutions at a rapid pace.","zh":"客戶成功是我們的核心價值之一，我們對它的關注使我們能夠隨著時間的推移加深和擴大與客戶的策略關係。由於我們專注於產業，因此我們對生命科學公司和臨床研究場所的需求和最佳實踐擁有獨特、深入的視角。這使我們能夠開發有針對性的解決方案，快速適應監管變化，並快速將高度相關的增強功能融入我們現有的解決方案中。"},{"en":"We are a Delaware public benefit corporation (\"PBC\"). A PBC is a for-profit company operating under subchapter XV of the General Corporation Law of the State of Delaware (i) that has adopted a public benefit purpose intended to provide benefits beyond just stockholder financial returns, and (ii) whose directors have a fiduciary duty to balance the financial interests of stockholders, the best interests of other stakeholders materially affected by the company's conduct (which we believe includes customers, employees, partners, and the communities in which we operate), and the pursuit of the company's public benefit purpose. Our public benefit purpose, as reflected in our certificate of incorporation, is \"to provide products and services that are intended to help make the industries we serve more productive, and to create high-quality employment opportunities in the communities in which we","zh":"我們是一家特拉華州公益公司（“PBC”）。 PBC 是一家根據特拉華州普通公司法第 XV 章運營的營利性公司，其 (i) 採用公共利益目的，旨在提供股東財務回報之外的利益，以及 (ii) 其董事負有信託責任，以平衡股東的財務利益、受公司行為重大影響的其他利益相關者的最佳利益（我們認為包括客戶、員工、合作夥伴和我們經營正如我們的公司證書所反映的那樣，我們的公益宗旨是“提供旨在幫助我們所服務的行業提高生產力的產品和服務，並在我們所在的社區創造高品質的就業機會”"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"As of January 31, 2026, we served 1,552 customers. For an explanation of how we define current customers, see \"Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations—Components of Results of Operations.\" We deliver solutions to companies throughout the life sciences industry, including pharmaceutical, biotechnology, and medical device companies, contract sales organizations, and contract research organizations. Our life sciences customers range from the largest global pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies such as Bayer AG, Boehringer Ingelheim GmbH, Eli Lilly and Company, Gilead Sciences, Inc., Merck Sharp & Dohme Corp., and Novartis Pharma AG, to emerging growth pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies, including Alkermes Inc., Alnylam Pharmaceuticals, Inc., bluebird bio, Inc., and Idorsia Pharmaceuticals Ltd. We also deliver solutions to companies ","zh":"截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日，我們為 1,552 名客戶提供服務。有關我們如何定義當前客戶的說明，請參閱「管理層對財務狀況和營運結果的討論和分析 - 營運結果的組成部分」。我們為整個生命科學產業的公司提供解決方案，包括製藥、生物技術和醫療器材公司、合約銷售組織和合約研究組織。我們的生命科學客戶包括拜耳股份公司、勃林格殷格翰有限公司、禮來公司、吉利德科學公司、默克夏普公司和諾華製藥公司等全球最大的製藥和生物技術公司，以及 Alkermes Inc.、Alnylam Pharmaceuticals, Inc.、bluebird bio, Inc. 和 Idorsia Pharmaceuticals Ltd 等新興公司。我們也為公司提供解決方案"},{"en":"As of January 31, 2026, we had 7,928 employees worldwide, up by 637 from the previous year. Our employees in the United States are not represented by a labor union; however, in certain foreign locations, local workers' councils represent our employees. We have not experienced any work stoppages, and we consider our relations with our employees to be very good.","zh":"截至2026年1月31日，我們在全球擁有7,928名員工，比前一年增加637名。我們在美國的員工沒有工會代表；然而，在某些國外地點，當地工人委員會代表我們的員工。我們沒有遇到任何停工情況，我們認為我們與員工的關係非常好。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets for our solutions are global, rapidly evolving, highly competitive, and subject to changing regulations, advancing technology, and shifting customer needs. In new sales cycles, we generally compete with other cloud-based solutions from providers that make applications geared toward the life sciences industry. Our CRM solutions primarily compete with Salesforce, which has developed a life sciences industry-specific CRM application. IQVIA, which historically offered a competitive CRM solution, has licensed its CRM software to Salesforce.","zh":"我們的解決方案的市場是全球性的、快速發展的、競爭激烈的，並受到不斷變化的法規、先進技術和不斷變化的客戶需求的影響。在新的銷售週期中，我們通常會與供應商提供的其他基於雲端的解決方案競爭，這些解決方案提供面向生命科學產業的應用程式。我們的 CRM 解決方案主要與 Salesforce 競爭，Salesforce 開發了生命科學產業特定的 CRM 應用程式。 IQVIA 一直提供具有競爭力的 CRM 解決方案，現已將其 CRM 軟體授權給 Salesforce。"},{"en":"Our Veeva Data Cloud products, as well as Veeva Crossix, compete with IQVIA Holdings, Inc., Ipsos Group S.A., Definitive Health Corp., and smaller data and data analytics providers.","zh":"我們的 Veeva Data Cloud 產品以及 Veeva Crossix 與 IQVIA Holdings, Inc.、Ipsos Group S.A.、Definitive Health Corp. 以及較小的數據和數據分析提供商競爭。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Subscription & Circulation","val":2684194000,"zh":"認購及流通"},{"name":"Subscription Services Veeva Research & Development & Quality Solutions","val":1426626000,"zh":"訂閱服務 Veeva 研發與品質解決方案"},{"name":"Subscription Services Veeva Commercial Cloud","val":1257568000,"zh":"訂閱服務 Veeva 商業雲"},{"name":"Technology Service","val":511117000,"zh":"技術服務"},{"name":"Professional Services Veeva Research & Development & Quality Solutions","val":321810000,"zh":"專業服務 Veeva 研發和品質解決方案"},{"name":"Professional Services Veeva Commercial Cloud","val":189307000,"zh":"專業服務 Veeva 商業雲"}],"total":3195311000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":1903342000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"Europe","val":939630000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":280162000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other International","val":72177000,"zh":"其他國際"}],"total":3195311000}},"peers":["TEAM","OKTA","WDAY","PAYC","TWLO"]}}